Course: Calculus I for Biological and Social Sciences. Section: Course Map. Content: The six chapters are organized into six teaching modules. Modules~1 and~2 both build directly on Module~0's function toolkit; Module~2's continuous-limit concept is a prerequisite for all of differential calculus (Modules~3--4) and integral calculus (Module~5). esizebox	extwidth!% , thick, color=primary ] 
